# Production build config — COMMITTED ON PURPOSE.
# These two values are public by design:
# - VITE_SUPABASE_URL is reachable by anyone by definition.
# - The anon key is the browser's public role; every table is locked by RLS
#   (owner_id = auth.uid()), so it cannot read or write anyone else's data.
# NEVER put the service_role key or OWNER_* credentials in a VITE_* variable
# or any committed file — those stay in the gitignored .env, server-side only.

